==Miscellaneous==
*The following units received the ability to target Zombies:
**[[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]], [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Li'l Nyandam]], [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Onmyoji Cat]], [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]], [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]], [[Piledriver Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Piledriver Cat]], [[Ganglion (Uber Rare Cat)|Ganglion]], [[Sarukani (Uber Rare Cat)|Sarukani]], [[Shining Amaterasu (Uber Rare Cat)|Shining Amaterasu]], [[Wrathful Poseidon (Uber Rare Cat)|Wrathful Poseidon]], [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Kesalan Pasalan]], [[Asiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Asilan Pasalan]], [[Kubiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Kubilan Pasalan]], [[Balaluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Balalan Pasalan]], [[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Gao]], and [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Filibuster Cat α]].
*Following Units to receive Zombie Killer ability:
**[[Li'l Valkyrie (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie]], Onmyoji Cat, [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]], Piledriver Cat, Sarukani, Ganglion, [[Anubis the Protector (Uber Rare Cat)|Anubis the Protector]], and Wrathful Poseidon.
*Added [[Catnip Challenges]] for clearing floors in the [[Heavenly Tower]].
*[[Cat Cannon|Trait Cannon]] now has the ability to label Cat Units as [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]].
*Units can now be leveled up to level 40 once clearing the Stories Of Legends 1*.
**The only units to not receive this raised level cap are Special Cats, Switch-Exclusive Cats, Legend Cats, and Crazed Cats.
*The following gacha banners have had their unlock requirement readjusted:
**[[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] instead of [[Greece (Empire of Cats)|Greece]].
**[[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] instead of [[Argentina (Empire of Cats)|Argentina]].
**[[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] instead of [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]].
** [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] instead of [[India (Into the Future)|India]].
**[[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[India (Into the Future)|India]] instead of [[Easter Island (Empire of Cats)|Easter Island]].
**[[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] instead of [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]].
**[[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[Easter Island (Into the Future)|Easter Island]] instead of [[Cosmic Lounge (Cats of the Cosmos)|Cosmic Lounge]].
**[[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] banner will be unlocked when clearing [[Cosmic Lounge (Cats of the Cosmos)|Cosmic lounge]] instead of [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]].
*UBERFEST banner is available 24/7 instead of the weekends.
*Gacha banners now list what stage is required to unlock them.
*[[Kabuto Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Kabuto Cat]] is now obtainable via login bonus.
*Fixed the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] banner to include [[Ganglion (Uber Rare Cat)|Ganglion]] in the banner art to be more accurate.
*Raised Kabuto Cat, Kuwagata Cat, and Corodragon's + level cap from +0 to +99

== Trivia ==

* Despite Li'l Valkyrie receiving the Zombie Killer ability, she is not present in neither '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions where she would be able to use this ability in-game as she is exclusive to the outdated '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version.
* Oddly enough, certain units did not receive Zombie targeting nor Zombie Killer abilities, that being Mr., Pastry Cat, and Driller Cat. Though logical that Mr. and Pastry Cat don't receive these changes as their True Forms go unused, however, Driller Cat is a special case as it targets everything but Zombies due to this update.
